  "argument": "arg-bm-diffusion-equation",
  "title": "The density one jump away",
  "spoken": "p at x minus Delta and t is approximately p minus Delta times the partial derivative of p with respect to x, plus Delta squared over two times the second partial derivative of p with respect to x.",
